flowchart TD
    accTitle: M10 anti-rollback sequence
    accDescr: A host checks a fetched head against reviewed ancestry and the generation high-water mark. A re-root needs a published archive and ordinary ratchet verification; otherwise the host holds and alerts.
    A["1 · Fetch<br/>Head arrives"] --> B{2 · Ancestry<br/>Descends from reviewed ref?}
    B -->|yes| C{3 · Generation<br/>At least high-water?}
    B -->|no, re-root| D{4 · Archive<br/>Published ref exists?}
    D -->|yes| E["5 · Verify<br/>Own reviewed ref inside archive"]
    E -->|verifies| F
    E -->|fails| H1
    D -->|no| H1
    C -->|yes| F["6 · Decide<br/>Adopt; advance marks"]
    C -->|no| H1["Hold + alert<br/>Rollback protection"]
